Map data
--------
The track outline in content/geometry.json is traced from "Madring (2026).svg"
by GabrielStella, hosted on Wikimedia Commons:

  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Madring_(2026).svg

That file is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0
Unported license (CC BY-SA 3.0):

