The traced geometry is a derivative of that work and is distributed under the
same license. The MIT license covering the source code does not extend to it.

Circuit facts
-------------
Corner names, incidents, gradients and speeds are authored content. Each one is
listed with its origin in content/sources.json. Speeds are a promoter
projection for a circuit that has not yet been raced, not a measured record.

